Package: libnanovg0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: antialiased 2D vector drawing on OpenGL
 NanoVG is a small antialiased vector graphics library for OpenGL, with an
 API modelled on the HTML5 canvas: paths, fills, strokes, gradients, images
 and text from TrueType fonts.

Package: libnanovg-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libnanovg0 (= ${binary:Version}), libgl-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: antialiased 2D vector drawing on OpenGL, development files
 The headers of NanoVG, its OpenGL backend (nanovg_gl.h, compiled into the
 program that includes it) and the pkg-config file nanovg.
